WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.093
CMMC 2.

00:00:01.093 --> 00:00:07.052
0 verifies cybersecurity implementation for protected information across the Defense Industrial Base.

00:00:07.052 --> 00:00:11.521
FCI and CUI drive information-protection, system-scope, and contract decisions.

00:00:11.521 --> 00:00:17.976
The three CMMC levels connect increasing requirements and assessment assurance to contract risk,

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:21.948
with Level 2 aligned to NIST SP 800-171.

00:00:21.948 --> 00:00:26.417
Strong programs integrate governance, engineering, operations, supplier management, evidence,

00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:28.900
assessment, monitoring, and continuous improvement.
